ubjected to any growth hormones, chemicals, antibiotics, genetically modified organisms, hyperimmunization or injected pathogens. \nAll other commercially available whey proteins use high heat pasteurization on the milk and whey. High heat does irreversible damage (denaturation) to the majority of the components of milk and may cause intolerance even in individuals who have no history of milk allergies."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Guaranteed GMP COMPLIANT Products"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Manufactured in an NSF GMP Registered Facility"},{"type":"Storage","notes":"STORE IN A COOL, DRY PLACE."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Notice: This is a natural product that may exhibit color, taste, and density variations from lot to lot. It contains naturally occuring micronutrients; therefore amounts may vary within the whey protein profile."},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"For Professional Use Only"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Proserum(R) THE FINEST NATIVE WHEY PROTEIN"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"- 3.2 g Immunoglobulins\n- 1.3 g Lactoferrin"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"- Unique Low Heat Processed\n- High in Glutathione Precursors"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"- rBGH Free"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains: Milk."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Milk."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Recommended Use: As a dietary supplement, mix 30 grams (approx. one scoop) in eight ounces of water or any other beverage per day, or as directed by your health care practitioner."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Whey Cool(TM), a proprietary non-denatured native whey protein concentrate, is produced to maintain the full range of all the fragile immune boosting and regenerative components naturally present in fresh raw milk. Whey Cool(TM) is produced using proprietary \u001ffiltration and drying which involves minimal processing. This unique production method ensures that the whey is not subjected to temperatures that would destroy the original components."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"We do not use cross-flow \u001ffiltration, microfiltration, hydrolyzation or ion exchange methods which denature the original proteins. \n"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"This full range, biologically active, complete amino acid profile native protein naturally contains an exceptional amount of the critical glutathione precursor covalent bonded cysteine. Additionally it contains the full range and exceptional levels of the most important protein components, which are lactoferrin, immunoglobulins, serum albumin, active peptides, glycomacropeptides and growth factors."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Typical Amino Acid Profile grams/30 gram Serving\nAlanine 1.1 g\nArginine 0.6 g\nAspartic acid 2.5 g\nCysteine 0.5 g\nGlutamic acid 4.0 g\nGlycine 0.4 g\nHistidine 0.4 g\nIsoleucine 1.4 g\nLeucine 2.4 g\nTypical Amino Acid Profile grams/30 gram Serving \nLysine 2.1 g\nMethionine 0.4 g\nPhenylalanine 0.7 g\nProline 1.3 g\nSerine 1.2 g\nThreonine 1.7 g\nTryptophan 0.4 g\nTyrosine 0.7 g\nValine 1.3 g"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Proserum(R) is a registered trademark of Wisdom Proteins, Inc."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Does not contain gluten."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"WCC900-1"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Proprietary Non-Denatured Whey Protein"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"}],"events":[{"date":"2013-09-25","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Ad